@startuml usecase-06-append
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam wrapWidth 170
title Use case 6 — append\n"normal send: user/director at the end of the chat + full history, streamed text answer"

actor User
participant "ChatNodeComponent\nsendDraft()" as UI
participant "LlmUseCaseRunner\n(env)" as RUN
participant "append\n(controller)" as UC
participant "buildSendMessagesEx\n(builder)" as BLDR
participant "LlmOrchestratorService\ncompletion()" as ORCH
participant "Evaluators\nfold + finalize" as EVAL
participant "LlmTransportService\nSSE" as XPORT
participant "LlmLogService" as LOG
participant "ChatService" as SVC
participant "Provider\n(proxy SSE)" as NET

== 1. Text-only send ==
User -> UI : Send (direction text)
UI -> UI : persistQuestion(chat, node, content, attachments)\nactivate(node)
UI -> RUN : runner.run(chat, node, 'append', { content })

== 2. Env ==
RUN -> RUN : resolveWriteModel(node) — node's model or first enabled\nbuildSendMessages (full chat)\ntextExtras (keeps temp/thinking/stream)
RUN --> UC : append(env)

== 3. Builder: topic system prompt + text-only history ==
UC -> BLDR : buildSendMessagesEx(chat, node, contentOverride)\n→ history text-only (image_url/file parts STRIPPED),\ntopic defaultSystemPrompt injected when no system msg
BLDR --> UC : sendMessages

== 4. Stream through the orchestrator ==
UC -> ORCH : completion({write}, expect:'text', stream:true)
ORCH -> XPORT : complete() — stream
XPORT -> LOG : record({ kind:'chat', body })/complete
XPORT -> NET : POST /chat/completions (stream:true)
loop each SSE chunk
  NET --> ORCH : chunk { content, thinking }
  ORCH -> EVAL : foldStreamChunk(running, chunk)
  EVAL --> EVAL : text slot = partial (growing)
  ORCH --> UC : onChunk (raw, unpaced)
  UC --> SVC : (view adapter paints the node live during stream)
end
XPORT --> ORCH : final raw
ORCH -> EVAL : finalizeStream(running, { raw })
EVAL --> ORCH : text slot (ok | refused, reason)
ORCH --> UC : EvalSlots { text }

== 5. Place (postprocessor / chat-node) ==
UC --> UI : slots
UI -> SVC : editAssistant(answerNode, content, thinking)\nsetActiveChild + activate(answer)
note over UI
  The node already carries the streamed content\n(live paint); the postprocessor only persists\nand versions it.
end note

@enduml